	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "2.0/2.1mm DC Jack - SMT\n<p>4UConnector: 03267</p>\n<p>Note: Small tRestrict polygon's were added to the ground pads to improve solderability when this part is used in combination with a ground pour.  By default, Eagle will product four large bridges to the ground pour significantly increasing the heat distribution on the pads and preventing lead-free solder from reflowing in certain situations.  For more details, see: http://www.microbuilder.eu/Blog/09-12-14/Reducing_Thermals_for_Large_Pads_in_Eagle.aspx</p>")
